            "review_title": "Review at Bánh Cuốn Lan Huệ",
            "review_text": "pngocduong1\nUnited States1252 contributions\n0\nLunch with family\nMay 2026 • Family\nWe stopped in for bánh cuốn and were impressed from the first bite. Everything was freshly made to order, and you could really taste the difference. The bánh cuốn was delicate, flavorful, and absolutely delicious.\nThey also offer a large drink menu with plenty of options to choose from, which was a nice bonus. On top of that, the prices were very reasonable, making it an excellent value for the quality of food. Fresh, delicious, and affordable definitely a spot worth visiting if you're craving authentic bánh cuốn.\nRead more\nWritten May 31, 2026",
